The verification goal is expressed as the dL sequent:

\psi_{\text{ps}} \vdash [dw_{\text{ps}}] \phi_{\text{ps}}

The proof proceeds by the following rules:

1. Induction Rule (Ind): Replaces the loop [\alpha^*]\phi with two subgoals: the base case (invariant holds initially) and the step case (invariant preserved by one iteration).
