Appendix J: Reaction Time Budget Analysis

J.1 Latency Components

Definition J.1 (Stopping Distance). The stopping distance is:

S_A = S_{Br} + S_{AnF} + S_{AnS}

where S_{Br} = v^2/(2a_{\max}) is the braking distance, S_{AnF} = v \cdot t_{\text{ctrl}} is the distance during vehicle control response, and S_{AnS} = v \cdot t_{\text{sensor}} is the distance during scanner response.

